<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Coffee With Stranger | Meet Someone New Over Coffee — Bengaluru</title>
<meta name="description" content="Scan a café QR, tell us who you'd like to meet, and share a coffee with a stranger who shares your interests. Free for the first 15 days in Bengaluru.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Pacifico&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/qrcodejs/1.0.0/qrcode.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.2/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.2/firebase-firestore-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.2/firebase-auth-compat.js"></script>
<style>
:root{
  --roast:#1d130e;
  --auto:#0d5b3e;
  --auto-dark:#093f2b;
  --yellow:#ffc72c;
  --paper:#eef2ec;
  --white:#ffffff;
  --muted:#5b665f;
  --line:#d3dcd2;
  --danger:#b3261e;
  --r-lg:22px; --r-md:14px; --r-sm:9px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:76px}
body{font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--paper);color:var(--roast);line-height:1.6;font-size:16px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque','Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.02em}
a{color:inherit}
button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--yellow);outline-offset:2px}
.wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
section{padding:84px 0}
.hidden{display:none!important}

/* free banner */
.free-bar{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--roast);text-align:center;font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;padding:9px 14px}
.free-bar b{font-weight:800}

/* nav */
nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(238,242,236,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:66px;gap:14px}
.brand{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque';font-weight:800;font-size:20px;text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;user-select:none}
.brand i{font-style:normal;display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--auto);color:var(--yellow);font-size:17px}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center}
.nav-links a{text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;color:var(--muted)}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--auto)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;border:2px solid transparent;border-radius:999px;padding:13px 24px;font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .15s,background .15s}
.btn:active{transform:scale(.97)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--auto);color:#fff}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--auto-dark)}
.btn-yellow{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--roast)}
.btn-yellow:hover{background:#ffd14f}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;border-color:var(--roast);color:var(--roast)}
.btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--roast);color:#fff}
.btn-sm{padding:8px 16px;font-size:14px}
.btn-danger{background:transparent;border-color:var(--danger);color:var(--danger)}
.bell{position:relative;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 14px;font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px}
.bell .dot{position:absolute;top:-6px;right:-4px;background:var(--danger);color:#fff;border-radius:999px;min-width:20px;height:20px;font-size:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0 5px}
.menu-btn{display:none;background:none;border:none;font-size:26px}

/* hero */
.hero{padding:64px 0 90px;background:var(--auto);color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-120px;bottom:-160px;width:460px;height:460px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--yellow);opacity:.16}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:48px;align-items:center;position:relative;z-index:1}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,6.4vw,78px);font-weight:800}
.hero h1 span{color:var(--yellow)}
.hero p.lead{font-size:19px;max-width:520px;margin:22px 0 30px;color:#d7ece0}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero .btn-ghost{border-color:#fff;color:#fff}
.hero .btn-ghost:hover{background:#fff;color:var(--auto)}
.hero-note{margin-top:22px;font-size:14.5px;color:#b9dcc9}

/* feeling alone section */
.feel{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe58f 0%,var(--yellow) 100%);padding:76px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.feel::before{content:"☕";position:absolute;right:4%;top:18px;font-size:140px;opacity:.14;transform:rotate(12deg)}
.feel .wrap{position:relative}
.feel h2{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,58px);font-weight:800;max-width:760px;line-height:1.08}
.feel h2 span{background:var(--roast);color:var(--yellow);padding:0 14px;border-radius:14px;display:inline-block;transform:rotate(-1.5deg)}
.feel .lead2{font-size:clamp(18px,2.2vw,22px);margin:18px 0 34px;max-width:640px;color:#3b2a14}
.feel-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.feel-card{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:26px;box-shadow:0 18px 36px -22px rgba(29,19,14,.55)}
.feel-card .em{font-size:38px;line-height:1}
.feel-card h3{font-size:22px;margin:12px 0 8px;font-weight:800}
.feel-card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:16.5px}
.feel-quote{margin-top:36px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.feel-quote q{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque';font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);font-weight:800;max-width:640px;line-height:1.2;quotes:none}
.feel-help{margin-top:22px;font-size:14px;color:#5a4620}
.feel-help a{color:inherit;font-weight:700}
/* terms and community rules */
.legal{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto}
.legal h2{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:4px}
.legal h3{font-size:20px;margin:26px 0 8px;scroll-margin-top:12px}
.legal p,.legal li{font-size:15.5px;color:#34403a;line-height:1.6}
.legal p{margin-top:8px}
.legal ul{padding-left:22px;margin-top:8px;display:grid;gap:6px}
.legal .note{background:#fff6dc;border:1px solid #ecd486;border-radius:var(--r-md);padding:12px 14px;margin-top:12px;font-size:15px}
.rules-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:34px;background:var(--roast);color:#fff;border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:36px}
.rules-card h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.8vw,42px);font-weight:800}
.rules-card p{margin:14px 0 22px;color:#e9dccf;font-size:17px}
.rules-card ul{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:12px;align-content:center}
.rules-card li{position:relative;padding-left:30px;font-size:16.5px}
.rules-card li::before{content:"✕";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;color:var(--yellow);font-weight:800}
.rules-card li.ok::before{content:"✓"}
.foot-grid a[data-terms]{cursor:pointer}
/* calendar */
.cal{background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-md);padding:12px;max-width:380px}
.cal-h{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px}
.cal-h b{font-size:17px}
.cal-nav{border:0;background:var(--paper);width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;font-size:22px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;color:var(--roast)}
.cal-nav:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default}
.cal-g{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:4px;text-align:center}
.cal-w{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);padding:4px 0}
.cal-d{border:0;background:var(--paper);border-radius:10px;height:42px;font:600 16px 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif;color:var(--roast);cursor:pointer}
.cal-d.today{outline:2px solid var(--auto)}
.cal-d.sel{background:var(--auto);color:#fff}
.cal-d.off{background:transparent;color:#b8c0b9;cursor:default;text-decoration:line-through}
.cal-picked{margin-top:10px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}

/* café poster preview and print */
#posterFrame{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.5);margin:14px auto 0;background:#fff}
#posterPrint{width:794px;height:1123px;transform-origin:top left}
#posterQR img,#posterQR canvas{display:block;width:264px;height:264px}
@media print{
  @page{size:A4;margin:0}
  body.printing-poster{background:#fff!important;overflow:visible!important}
  body.printing-poster > *{display:none!important}
  body.printing-poster > #posterOv{display:block!important;position:static!important;background:none!important;padding:0!important;overflow:visible!important}
  body.printing-poster #posterOv .modal{box-shadow:none!important;max-width:none!important;padding:0!important;background:none!important;animation:none!important}
  body.printing-poster #posterOv .modal > *:not(#posterFrame){display:none!important}
  body.printing-poster #posterFrame{width:793px!important;height:1121px!important;overflow:hidden!important;border-radius:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;margin:0!important}
  body.printing-poster #posterPrint{transform:none!important;width:793px!important;height:1121px!important}
  #posterPrint,#posterPrint *{-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact}
}

/* hero picture */
.hero-visual{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:520px;margin-left:auto}
.couple-wrap{position:relative;animation:heroRise .8s ease both}
.couple-wrap::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:16px -14px -14px 16px;border-radius:30px;background:var(--yellow);transform:rotate(3deg);z-index:0}
.couple{position:relative;z-index:1;border-radius:26px;overflow:hidden;border:6px solid #fff;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.55);transform:rotate(-2deg)}
.couple img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
.sticker{position:absolute;top:-30px;right:-8px;z-index:5;width:124px;height:124px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--roast);color:var(--yellow);display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;transform:rotate(10deg);box-shadow:0 14px 28px -10px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
.sticker::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:6px;border-radius:50%;border:2px dashed var(--yellow)}
.sticker b{display:block;font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque';font-size:36px;line-height:1;font-weight:800}
.sticker span{display:block;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-top:2px}
.sticker em{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--yellow)}
.cap{position:absolute;left:-12px;bottom:26px;z-index:5;background:#fff;color:var(--roast);border-radius:999px;padding:9px 18px;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -10px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.hero-visual .ticket{position:relative;z-index:6;max-width:340px;margin:-58px 0 0 auto}
@keyframes heroRise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

/* the notification ticket (hero centrepiece) */
.ticket{background:var(--white);color:var(--roast);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:22px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.45);transform:rotate(2deg);max-width:400px;margin-left:auto;animation:pop .9s cubic-bezier(.2,1.2,.4,1) .3s both}
@keyframes pop{from{opacity:0;transform:rotate(-4deg) translateY(40px) scale(.92)}to{opacity:1;transform:rotate(2deg)}}
.ticket .tk-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--auto);margin-bottom:14px}
.ticket .pulse{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--danger);box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(179,38,30,.6);animation:pulse 1.8s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 12px rgba(179,38,30,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(179,38,30,0)}}
.tk-person{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
.avatar{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--yellow);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque';font-weight:800;font-size:22px;flex:none}
.tk-person h3{font-size:20px}
.tk-person small{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.chips-static{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:14px 0}
.chip-s{background:var(--paper);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 11px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.tk-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:6px}
.tk-actions .btn{flex:1;padding:11px 12px;font-size:14.5px}
.ticket-cut{border-top:2px dashed var(--line);margin:16px -22px 12px}
.tk-foot{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

/* sections */
.sec-head{max-width:640px;margin-bottom:44px}
.sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px);font-weight:800}
.sec-head p{margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:18px}

/* steps */
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;counter-reset:s}
.step{background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:26px 22px;border:1px solid var(--line);position:relative}
.step::before{counter-increment:s;content:counter(s);position:absolute;top:-16px;left:20px;background:var(--yellow);width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque';font-weight:800}
.step .ic{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:10px}
.step h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:8px}
.step p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15.5px}

/* register */
.reg-wrap{background:var(--roast);color:#fff}
.reg-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:44px;align-items:start}
.reg-side h2{font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,52px);font-weight:800}
.reg-side p{color:#cbbfb7;margin-top:16px;font-size:17px}
.free-pill{display:inline-block;background:var(--yellow);color:var(--roast);font-weight:800;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 16px;margin-top:22px}
.scan-box{margin-top:26px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:var(--r-md);padding:18px;display:none;font-size:15.5px}
.scan-box.on{display:block}
.scan-box b{color:var(--yellow)}
.form-card{background:var(--white);color:var(--roast);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:30px}
fieldset{border:none;margin-bottom:26px}
legend{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque';font-weight:700;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px;padding:0}
legend small{display:block;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk';font-weight:500;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;margin-bottom:12px}
.field label{font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px}
input[type=text],input[type=tel],input[type=email],input[type=number],input[type=password],select,textarea{width:100%;font:inherit;padding:12px 14px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-sm);background:#fbfcfb;color:var(--roast)}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--auto);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(13,91,62,.15)}
textarea{min-height:76px;resize:vertical}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px}
.chip{position:relative}
.chip input{position:absolute;opacity:0;inset:0;cursor:pointer;width:100%;height:100%}
.chip span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:9px 15px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;background:#fbfcfb;transition:all .12s;user-select:none}
.chip input:checked+span{background:var(--auto);border-color:var(--auto);color:#fff}
.chip input:focus-visible+span{outline:3px solid var(--yellow);outline-offset:2px}
.chip small{font-weight:500;opacity:.75;font-size:12.5px}
.link-btn{background:none;border:none;color:var(--auto);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:underline;margin-top:10px}
.consent{display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 18px;align-items:flex-start}
.consent input{margin-top:4px;width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:var(--auto)}
.err{color:var(--danger);font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;margin-bottom:12px;min-height:0}
.signin-line{margin-top:14px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center}

/* cafes */
.cafe-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:18px}
.cafe{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.cafe .badge{align-self:flex-start;background:var(--yellow);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 11px;border-radius:999px}
.cafe .badge.soon{background:var(--paper);color:var(--muted)}
.cafe h3{font-size:21px;margin-top:6px}
.cafe p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}
.cafe .btn{margin-top:auto;align-self:flex-start}

/* owners + safety */
.owner{background:var(--yellow)}
.owner-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:44px;align-items:start}
.owner h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px);font-weight:800}
.perk{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px;font-weight:500}
.perk b{display:block;font-size:17px}
.perk span.i{font-size:24px}
.safety-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}
.safe{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:22px}
.safe .ic{font-size:28px}
.safe h3{font-size:19px;margin:8px 0 6px}
.safe p{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted)}
.faq details{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-md);padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:12px}
.faq summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-size:17px}
.faq p{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)}
.founder{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:26px;align-items:center;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:30px}
.founder .avatar{width:84px;height:84px;font-size:36px}
.founder blockquote{margin-top:12px;font-size:18px;font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque';font-weight:500;line-height:1.35}

footer{background:var(--roast);color:#cbbfb7;padding:48px 0 30px;font-size:15px}
footer a{text-decoration:none}
footer a:hover{color:var(--yellow)}
.foot-grid{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.foot-grid h4{color:#fff;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px}
.copy{margin-top:30px;border-top:1px solid #3a2c24;padding-top:18px;font-size:13.5px;cursor:default;user-select:none}

/* modal */
.overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(29,19,14,.62);z-index:100;display:none;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;overflow-y:auto;padding:30px 14px}
.overlay.on{display:flex}
.modal{background:var(--paper);border-radius:var(--r-lg);width:100%;max-width:640px;padding:28px;position:relative;animation:rise .25s ease-out}
.modal.wide{max-width:980px}
@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.modal h2{font-size:28px;margin-bottom:6px}
.x{position:absolute;top:14px;right:16px;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;font-size:18px}
.match{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:20px;margin-top:14px}
.match.new{border-color:var(--auto);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(13,91,62,.12)}
.match .top{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
.match h3{font-size:20px}
.match small{color:var(--muted)}
.tag-mutual{background:var(--yellow);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px;margin-left:6px;vertical-align:middle}
.match .row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.confirmed{background:var(--auto);color:#fff;border-radius:var(--r-md);padding:16px;margin-top:14px}
.confirmed b{color:var(--yellow)}
.waiting{background:var(--paper);border-radius:var(--r-md);padding:12px 14px;margin-top:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted)}
.empty{text-align:center;padding:36px 10px;color:var(--muted)}
.empty .ic{font-size:40px}

/* admin */
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin:18px 0}
.stat{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-md);padding:14px}
.stat b{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque';font-size:30px;display:block}
.stat span{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.admin-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:20px}
.panel{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:20px}
.panel h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:12px}
.acafe{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:14px 0}
.acafe:first-of-type{border-top:none}
.acafe .qr{flex:none;background:#fff;padding:6px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.acafe .info{flex:1;font-size:14.5px;min-width:0}
.acafe .info b{font-size:16.5px}
.acafe .acts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.req{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 0;font-size:14.5px}
.admin-note{background:#fff6dc;border:1px solid #ecd486;border-radius:var(--r-md);padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;margin-top:14px}

.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:24px;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(30px);background:var(--roast);color:#fff;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;z-index:200;opacity:0;transition:all .3s;max-width:92vw;text-align:center}
.toast.on{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%)}

@media(max-width:900px){
  .hero-grid,.reg-grid,.owner-grid,.admin-cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .ticket{margin:10px auto 0}
  .rules-card{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:26px}
  .feel-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .hero-visual{margin:14px auto 0}
  .hero-visual .ticket{margin:-44px auto 0}
  .sticker{width:98px;height:98px;top:-22px;right:-4px}
  .sticker b{font-size:27px}
  .sticker span{font-size:11px}
  .sticker em{font-size:10.5px}
  .cap{font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;left:-6px;bottom:20px}
  .steps,.safety-grid,.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .nav-links{display:none;position:absolute;top:66px;left:0;right:0;background:var(--paper);flex-direction:column;padding:18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);align-items:flex-start}
  .nav-links.open{display:flex}
  .menu-btn{display:block}
  section{padding:64px 0}
}
@media(max-width:560px){
  .steps,.safety-grid,.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .founder{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .form-card{padding:20px}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="free-bar" id="freeBar">Free for the first <span class="fd">15 days</span>. No registration fee. <b id="freeCount"></b></div>

<nav>
  <div class="wrap nav-in">
    <a href="#top" class="brand" id="brand"><i>☕</i> Coffee With Stranger</a>
    <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#cafes">Cafés</a>
      <a href="#owners">For café owners</a>
      <a href="#safety">Safety</a>
      <button class="bell" id="bellBtn">🔔 My matches <span class="dot hidden" id="bellDot">0</span></button>
      <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="#register">Register free</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <h1>One coffee. <span>One stranger</span> who gets you.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Scan the QR at a partner café, tell us who you'd like to meet, and we'll tell you when someone matching your interests says yes. No swiping. Just a table for two.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-yellow" href="#register">Register free</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#how">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">Starting in Bengaluru. Public cafés only. Free for the first <span class="fd">15 days</span>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="couple-wrap">
        <figure class="couple"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," width="720" height="534" alt="A man and a woman smiling and talking over cups of coffee at a café table"></figure>
        <div class="sticker" id="stickerFree"><div><b>FREE</b><span>registration</span><em id="stickerSub">for 15 days</em></div></div>
        <div class="cap">☕ Say hello over coffee</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ticket" aria-label="Example match notification">
        <div class="tk-top"><span class="pulse"></span> New match for your interests</div>
        <div class="tk-person">
          <div class="avatar">A</div>
          <div><h3>Ananya, 27</h3><small>Lawyer · Indiranagar</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="chips-static"><span class="chip-s">Books</span><span class="chip-s">Travel</span><span class="chip-s">Startups</span></div>
        <div class="tk-actions"><span class="btn btn-primary">Yes, let's meet</span><span class="btn btn-ghost">Not now</span></div>
        <div class="ticket-cut"></div>
        <div class="tk-foot">If you both say yes, we pick the café and you scan its QR to check in. (Example card)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>From QR scan to coffee in four steps</h2>
      <p>You choose who you'd like to meet. Nobody gets your phone number until you both agree.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="ic">📱</div><h3>Scan and register</h3><p>Scan a café QR code and fill in your name, work, interests, area and what you like.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="ic">🎯</div><h3>Pick who you'd like to meet</h3><p>Choose a gender preference and one or many groups: IT, doctors, lawyers, film people, students and more.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="ic">🔔</div><h3>Get a match alert</h3><p>When someone fits your choices, you see their profile and tap OK if you'd like to meet.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="ic">☕</div><h3>Meet at the café</h3><p>When both of you tap OK, you get a partner café and slot. Scan the café's QR to check in.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="reg-wrap" id="register">
  <div class="wrap reg-grid">
    <div class="reg-side">
      <h2>Tell us who you are and who you'd like to meet</h2>
      <p>It takes about two minutes. You can pick as many groups as you like.</p>
      <span class="free-pill">Free for <span class="fd">15 days</span></span>
      <div class="scan-box" id="scanBox">You scanned the QR at <b id="scanCafe"></b>. We've picked this café for you.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-card">
      <form id="regForm" novalidate>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>About you</legend>
          <div class="grid2">
            <div class="field"><label for="f_name">Full name</label><input type="text" id="f_name" autocomplete="name" required></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="f_age">Age (18 or above)</label><input type="number" id="f_age" min="18" max="90" inputmode="numeric" required></div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid2">
            <div class="field"><label for="f_phone">Phone number</label><input type="tel" id="f_phone" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" required></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="f_email">Email (optional)</label><input type="email" id="f_email" autocomplete="email"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid2">
            <div class="field"><label for="f_gender">You are</label>
              <select id="f_gender" required><option value="">Select</option><option>Male</option><option>Female</option><option>Other</option></select></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="f_place">Your area in Bengaluru</label>
              <select id="f_place" required></select></div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset>
          <legend>Your occupation<small>Pick the group that fits you best.</small></legend>
          <div class="field"><select id="f_cat" required></select></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="f_role">Job title or what you do (optional)</label><input type="text" id="f_role" placeholder="Example: Software engineer, short film director"></div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset>
          <legend>Fields you're interested in<small>Pick any.</small></legend>
          <div class="chips" id="fieldChips"></div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset>
          <legend>What you like<small>Pick any, or write your own below.</small></legend>
          <div class="chips" id="likeChips"></div>
          <div class="field" style="margin-top:12px"><textarea id="f_about" placeholder="One or two lines about you (optional)"></textarea></div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset>
          <legend>Who would you like to have coffee with?</legend>
          <div class="chips" id="genderChips" style="margin-bottom:18px"></div>
          <div class="chips" id="wantChips"></div>
          <button type="button" class="link-btn" id="selAll">Select all groups</button>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset>
          <legend>Where and when</legend>
          <div class="grid2">
            <div class="field"><label for="f_cafe">Preferred café</label><select id="f_cafe"></select></div>
          </div>
          <div class="field" style="margin-top:8px"><label>Which dates can you meet? Tap the dates on the calendar (choose all that suit you)</label>
            <div class="cal" id="calBox"></div>
            <div class="cal-picked" id="calPicked"></div></div>
          <div class="field" style="margin-top:8px"><label>What time suits you? Pick one-hour slots (choose all that suit you)</label>
            <p id="timeNote" style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 6px"></p>
            <div class="chips" id="timeChips"></div></div>
          <p style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">When you and a match both say OK, we confirm the earliest day and time you both chose. You will get the date, time and café map on screen and by WhatsApp or email.</p>
        </fieldset>

        <label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" id="f_ok"> <span>I am 18 or above. I agree to meet only in a public café, to share my profile (without my phone number) with people who match, and to be contacted by Coffee With Stranger on this number about matches. I have read and accept the <a href="#" data-terms="t-terms">Terms and Conditions</a>, the <a href="#" data-terms="t-conduct">code of conduct</a> and the <a href="#" data-terms="t-privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</span></label>
        <div class="err" id="regErr" role="alert"></div>
        <button class="btn btn-yellow" style="width:100%" type="submit">Register and see my matches</button>
        <p class="signin-line">Already registered? <button type="button" class="link-btn" id="signinBtn" style="margin:0">Sign in with your phone number</button></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="cafes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Partner cafés</h2>
      <p>Every café has its own QR code. Scan it at the table to register or to check in for your meetup.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cafe-grid" id="cafeGrid"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="owner" id="owners">
  <div class="wrap owner-grid">
    <div>
      <h2>Own a café? Join the network.</h2>
      <p style="margin-top:16px;font-size:18px">We send you people who come to talk, stay for a while and order more. Listing is free.</p>
      <div class="perk"><span class="i">📈</span><div><b>More footfall</b>Every meetup brings at least two guests to your tables.</div></div>
      <div class="perk"><span class="i">🧾</span><div><b>Zero cost to join</b>Free during launch, with no setup fee.</div></div>
      <div class="perk"><span class="i">🔳</span><div><b>Your own QR code</b>Once approved, you get a printable QR for your tables.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-card">
      <form id="ownerForm">
        <h3 style="font-size:24px;margin-bottom:14px">Request a listing</h3>
        <div class="field"><label for="o_name">Café name</label><input type="text" id="o_name" required></div>
        <div class="grid2">
          <div class="field"><label for="o_owner">Your name</label><input type="text" id="o_owner" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="o_phone">Phone</label><input type="tel" id="o_phone" required></div>
        </div>
        <div class="field"><label for="o_email">Email (optional)</label><input type="email" id="o_email"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="o_addr">Area and landmark</label><input type="text" id="o_addr" required></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="o_hours">Opening hours</label><input type="text" id="o_hours" placeholder="Example: 8 AM – 10 PM"></div>
        <div class="err" id="ownerErr" role="alert"></div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%" type="submit">Send request</button>
        <p class="signin-line">We call you within 48 hours.</p>
      </form>
      <div id="ownerDone" class="hidden" style="margin-top:16px;padding:16px;border-radius:14px;background:#FFF4E0;color:#2A1810">
        <b>Request received.</b> We will call you within 48 hours. For a faster reply, send it to us on WhatsApp too.
        <div style="margin-top:12px"><a class="btn btn-yellow btn-sm" id="ownerWa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Message us on WhatsApp</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="safety">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><h2>Built for safe first meetings</h2></div>
    <div class="safety-grid">
      <div class="safe"><div class="ic">📞</div><h3>Phone number required</h3><p>Every member registers with a phone number. Anonymous profiles are not accepted.</p></div>
      <div class="safe"><div class="ic">🏪</div><h3>Public cafés only</h3><p>All meetups happen in busy partner cafés. We never arrange private meetings.</p></div>
      <div class="safe"><div class="ic">🤝</div><h3>Both must say yes</h3><p>Nothing is confirmed until both people tap OK. Your phone number stays hidden.</p></div>
      <div class="safe"><div class="ic">🚪</div><h3>Leave any time</h3><p>Not feeling it? Skip a match or walk out. No questions asked.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="rules" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rules-card">
      <div>
        <h2>Our one rule: be respectful</h2>
        <p>Coffee With Stranger is for friendly, safe conversations. Everyone agrees to these rules when they register.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-yellow" href="#" data-terms="t-terms">Read the Terms and Conditions</a>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li>No abuse, threats, bullying or insulting language.</li>
        <li>No vulgar, sexual or obscene talk, jokes, gestures or touching. No means no.</li>
        <li>No stalking, and no contacting someone again after they have said no.</li>
        <li>No selling, recruiting, begging, or asking for money or bank details.</li>
        <li>No photos, videos or sharing of anyone's details without their permission.</li>
        <li class="ok">Meet only inside the café, and never share OTPs, your home address or ID numbers.</li>
        <li class="ok">Break these rules and you are removed. Serious cases go to the police.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="founder">
      <div class="avatar">M</div>
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-size:24px">Moorthi R, Founder</h3>
        <blockquote>"In a city of millions, it is still possible to feel alone. We don't need more followers. We need more face-to-face moments."</blockquote>
        <p style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)">📞 <a href="tel:+919741239979">97412 39979</a> &nbsp; ✉ <a href="mailto:meetsomeonenew@coffeewithstranger.com">meetsomeonenew@coffeewithstranger.com</a> &nbsp; 💬 <a href="https://wa.me/919741239979">WhatsApp</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feel" id="alone">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Feeling alone today? <span>Meet a stranger.</span></h2>
    <p class="lead2">Sometimes the quickest way to change your mood is one new conversation, one warm cup, and one person who has a story you haven't heard.</p>
    <div class="feel-grid">
      <div class="feel-card"><div class="em">🌧️</div><h3>Mood feeling low?</h3><p>A new face and a hot coffee can turn a grey afternoon around. You don't have to explain anything. Just say hello.</p></div>
      <div class="feel-card"><div class="em">💡</div><h3>Want to learn something new?</h3><p>Everyone you meet knows something you don't: a job, a city, a skill, a book, a story. Come curious and leave with an idea.</p></div>
      <div class="feel-card"><div class="em">🤝</div><h3>Missing your kind of people?</h3><p>Meet someone who shares your interests, at a table for two in a busy café. No pressure and no swiping.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="feel-quote">
      <q>A stranger is just a friend you haven't met yet.</q>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#register">Meet someone today</a>
    </div>
    <p class="feel-help">A coffee chat is not a replacement for professional help. If you are feeling very low, please talk to someone you trust or call Tele-MANAS, the free mental health helpline, on <a href="tel:14416">14416</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="faq" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:800px">
    <div class="sec-head"><h2>Questions</h2></div>
    <details><summary>Is it really free?</summary><p>Yes. For the first <span class="fd">15 days</span> there is no registration fee. You only pay for what you order at the café.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can I choose who I meet?</summary><p>Yes. You choose a gender preference and any number of groups, such as IT, doctors, police, lawyers, business owners, startup people, real estate, film industry (short film artists, directors, models), construction, students or others.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How will I know someone matches?</summary><p>You see an alert on the 🔔 My matches button. Open it to view their profile and tap OK if you'd like to meet.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What does the café QR do?</summary><p>It links you to that café. Scan it to register at that venue, and scan it again when you arrive to check in for your confirmed meetup.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is this a dating service?</summary><p>No. Coffee With Stranger is for conversations, friendships and networking in public cafés.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="foot-grid">
      <div><h4>☕ Coffee With Stranger</h4>Structured, in-person coffee meetups in partner cafés.<br>Bengaluru, India</div>
      <div><h4>Contact</h4><a href="mailto:meetsomeonenew@coffeewithstranger.com">meetsomeonenew@coffeewithstranger.com</a><br><a href="https://wa.me/919741239979">WhatsApp +91 97412 39979</a></div>
      <div><h4>Explore</h4><a href="#how">How it works</a><br><a href="#cafes">Cafés</a><br><a href="#owners">For café owners</a></div>
      <div><h4>Legal</h4><a href="#" data-terms="t-terms">Terms and Conditions</a><br><a href="#" data-terms="t-conduct">Code of conduct</a><br><a href="#" data-terms="t-privacy">Privacy Policy</a><br><a href="#" data-terms="t-grievance">Grievance Officer</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="copy" id="copy">© 2026 Coffee With Stranger. Made with ☕ in Bengaluru by Moorthi R</div>
  </div>
</footer>

<!-- My matches modal -->
<div class="overlay" id="termsOv" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Terms and Conditions">
  <div class="modal" style="max-width:860px">
    <button class="x" data-close="termsOv" aria-label="Close">✕</button>
    <div class="legal">
      <h2 id="t-terms">Terms and Conditions</h2>
      <p><b>Coffee With Stranger</b> · Bengaluru, India · Last updated 13 October 2026</p>
      <p>Please read these terms before you register. By registering or using Coffee With Stranger (the "Service") you agree to them. If you do not agree, please do not use the Service. These terms are an electronic record under the Information Technology Act, 2000 and the rules made under it. They do not need a physical signature.</p>

      <h3>1. What we do</h3>
      <p>Coffee With Stranger helps adults in Bengaluru meet new people for a friendly conversation in a public partner café. We suggest people based on the details you give us. We are a platform that connects members and cafés. We do not promise that you will get a match, that a match will turn up, or that you will enjoy the meeting. Meetings are for friendship, conversation and networking. This is not a dating or escort service.</p>

      <h3>2. Who can use it</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>You must be 18 years or older. People under 18 may not register.</li>
        <li>Give true details, use your own phone number, keep your information up to date, and keep one profile only.</li>
        <li>Do not pretend to be someone else or create fake or duplicate profiles.</li>
        <li>We may refuse, pause or end anyone's registration at any time if these terms are broken or if we think a member's safety is at risk.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 id="t-conduct">3. Code of conduct: how we expect you to behave</h3>
      <p>Every member must treat other members, café staff and café guests with respect. You must not:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>abuse, insult, bully, threaten, shame or harass anyone, in person, on the phone, on WhatsApp or in any other way;</li>
        <li>use vulgar, obscene or sexual language, jokes, gestures, messages or images, or make unwelcome sexual or romantic advances;</li>
        <li>touch anyone without clear consent, or do anything that makes another person feel unsafe;</li>
        <li>stalk or follow anyone, or contact a person again after they said no or left the conversation, including turning up at their home or workplace;</li>
        <li>discriminate against anyone or use hateful language about their religion, caste, gender, sexual orientation, region, language, disability, appearance or job;</li>
        <li>pressure or upset others with arguments about politics or religion, or try to convert, recruit or convince anyone;</li>
        <li>sell, advertise or promote anything, including network marketing, insurance, investments, loans or services;</li>
        <li>ask for or offer money, gifts, loans or donations, or ask for bank details, OTPs, passwords or ID numbers;</li>
        <li>take photos or videos of another person, or share their name, phone number, workplace, social media or photos, without their permission;</li>
        <li>use the Service for scams, cheating, fraud, blackmail, or any activity that breaks the law;</li>
        <li>bring alcohol, drugs, weapons or anything illegal or dangerous to a meeting, or arrive intoxicated;</li>
        <li>disturb the café, its staff or other customers, or break the café's own rules;</li>
        <li>misuse the website, including scraping data, using bots, trying to hack it or overload it.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note"><b>The law:</b> abusive, threatening, obscene, stalking or privacy-invading behaviour can be a criminal offence under the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023 and the Information Technology Act, 2000. We will cooperate with the police and courts.</p>

      <h3>4. Meeting safely</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Meet only inside the partner café we confirm, at the confirmed date and time. Never move to a private place or get into a vehicle with someone you have just met.</li>
        <li>Come and leave on your own, and tell a friend or family member where you are going.</li>
        <li>Never share your home address, OTPs, bank or card details, Aadhaar or other ID numbers.</li>
        <li>We do not carry out police verification or background checks on members. Treat everyone as a stranger until you know them.</li>
        <li>If you feel unsafe or uncomfortable, stop and leave. Tell the café staff and report it to us.</li>
        <li>In an emergency call 112 (police, fire, ambulance) or 1091 (Women Helpline). For online fraud call 1930 or visit cybercrime.gov.in.</li>
        <li>If you cannot come, tell us as early as you can. Repeated no-shows may lead to removal.</li>
        <li>Scanning the café's QR code when you arrive helps us know you reached safely.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 id="t-fees">5. Matches, cafés and fees</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>A meeting is arranged only when both people say yes. Seeing someone as available is not a promise that they will meet you.</li>
        <li>The date and time come from the dates and one-hour slots you choose and the café's opening hours. They may change, and if they do we will tell you.</li>
        <li>Partner cafés are independent businesses. They are not our employees or agents. We are not responsible for their food, service, prices, safety or staff. You pay for your own orders.</li>
        <li>Registration is free for the first <span class="fd">15 days</span>. If we start charging, we will show the fee clearly before you pay, include GST where applicable, and take no money without your clear consent. A refund policy will be shown before any fee is charged.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 id="t-privacy">6. Your data and privacy</h3>
      <p>We handle your personal data in line with the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 and the rules made under it.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><b>What we collect:</b> your name, age, gender, phone number, email (optional), area, occupation group and role, interests, who you would like to meet, your available dates and times, your café choice, and your match choices and check-ins.</li>
        <li><b>Why:</b> to register you, find and show matches, confirm meetings, message you about them, keep the Service safe, and meet our legal duties.</li>
        <li><b>What other members see:</b> a matched member can see your first name, age, area, job details, interests and what you wrote about yourself. Your phone number and email are never shown to other members.</li>
        <li><b>Who helps us:</b> your data is stored with Google Firebase (Google Cloud), emails are sent through EmailJS, and we may message you on WhatsApp or by phone. Some processing may happen on servers outside India.</li>
        <li><b>We do not sell your data.</b> We share it only with the service providers above, or with the police, courts or government when the law requires it or to protect someone's safety.</li>
        <li><b>Your consent:</b> by registering, you agree to this use of your data. You can withdraw your consent at any time by writing to us. We will then delete your profile.</li>
        <li><b>How long we keep it:</b> while your profile is active. We delete your data within 30 days of your request unless the law requires us to keep it. Profiles unused for 12 months may be deleted.</li>
        <li><b>Your rights:</b> you can ask for a summary of your data, ask us to correct or delete it, withdraw consent, nominate another person to act for you, or make a complaint to our Grievance Officer below.</li>
        <li><b>Security:</b> we keep phone numbers and emails visible only to us and use reasonable safeguards. No system is completely secure. Tell us at once if you suspect misuse of your data.</li>
        <li><b>Children:</b> the Service is only for people aged 18 and over. We do not knowingly collect children's data and will delete it if we find it.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>7. Reporting and action</h3>
      <p>If anyone breaks these rules or makes you uncomfortable, tell us at meetsomeonenew@coffeewithstranger.com or on WhatsApp +91 97412 39979. We may warn, pause or permanently remove a member, without any refund, and stop showing their profile. We may give information to the police or a court where the law requires it or to protect someone's safety. We will not tell the reported person who made the report unless the law requires us to.</p>

      <h3>8. Responsibility and liability</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>You meet other members at your own risk and are responsible for your own decisions and behaviour.</li>
        <li>We act as an intermediary. We are not responsible for what members say or do, or for loss, injury, theft or harm connected to a meeting, except where Indian law does not allow us to exclude it.</li>
        <li>The Service is provided "as is". We try to keep it running but it may be paused for maintenance or for reasons outside our control.</li>
        <li>To the extent the law allows, our total liability for any claim is limited to the fees you paid us in the last 12 months (nothing, if the Service was free). Nothing here limits your rights under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019 or any other law that cannot be waived.</li>
        <li>If you break these terms or the law and we suffer a claim or loss because of it, you agree to compensate us for that loss.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>9. Our name and your content</h3>
      <p>The name Coffee With Stranger, the website and its design belong to us and may not be copied. You keep ownership of what you write in your profile, but you allow us to show it to matched members for the purpose of the Service. Do not post anything that infringes someone else's rights.</p>

      <h3>10. Changes to these terms</h3>
      <p>We may update these terms. The latest version, with its date, is always on this website. If we make an important change, we will tell you on the website or by message. If you keep using the Service after a change, you accept it.</p>

      <h3>11. Governing law and disputes</h3>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Please contact us first so we can try to solve any problem fairly. If it cannot be solved, the courts at Bengaluru, Karnataka have jurisdiction.</p>

      <h3 id="t-grievance">12. Grievance Officer</h3>
      <p>As required by the Information Technology (Intermediary Guidelines and Digital Media Ethics Code) Rules, 2021 and the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Grievance Officer:</b> Moorthi R</li>
        <li><b>Email:</b> <a href="mailto:meetsomeonenew@coffeewithstranger.com">meetsomeonenew@coffeewithstranger.com</a></li>
        <li><b>Phone / WhatsApp:</b> <a href="tel:+919741239979">+91 97412 39979</a></li>
        <li><b>Address:</b> Bengaluru, Karnataka, India</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We acknowledge every complaint within 24 hours and aim to resolve it within 15 days. Urgent complaints about safety, harassment or privacy are looked at first.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
