    <p style="color:var(--muted)">This poster has its own QR code for this café. Click the button, then choose <b>Save as PDF</b> (to send to the café) or print it on A4. If the colours look pale, tick <b>Background graphics</b> in the print window.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px"><button class="btn btn-primary" id="posterPrintBtn" type="button">Print / Save as PDF</button></div>
    <div id="posterFrame"><div id="posterPrint"></div></div>
  </div>
</div>
